                                                             Figure 5: As Figure 3, under J-lens. Provisional pending replay validation.

For contrast only, the same internal-band mean gaps computed on the unmatched groups (137
failures against all 488 successes) are −16,569 for failures and +5,612 for successes under the logit
lens. The failure figure is unchanged because all 137 failures already lie inside the matched stratum;
the success figure is not, which is the confound in one number. These unmatched values are reported
here and nowhere else.

C                                              Planned patching experiment
For each of the 137 failures, patch attention-head outputs at depths 19–22 from a condition-matched
success in the same cell, and measure the rate at which the output flips to the correct room. The target
heads are the top-ranked ones from the per-head analysis in Section 5, which concentrate in depths
19–22. Controls: random heads at the same depths; heads ranked lowest by the same committed
head ranking; and mean-ablation of the top-k stale-preferring heads. A patch applied at the decision
token can transfer the donor’s answer outright, which is answer-copying rather than localization; the
donor-mismatch control detects this. Metrics and corruption choices follow Zhang and Nanda [2024].
Script: patch probe.py. Not run: no GPU was available.

D                                              J-lens replay diagnostic
jlens diag.py runs bf16 and fp16 arms plus a small-model dtype ladder and computes KL between
the replayed and real softmaxes in both directions. It remains unrun: no CUDA device was
available for this work, and the one diagnostic invocation the authors did perform (Section 6) was
not committed, so nothing from it is cited.
What running it would settle. If fp32 gives KL on the order of 10−4 while bf16 is order 1 at the same
tolerance, the discrepancy is numerical precision in the replay rather than a fault in the truncated
stack, and the depth-5 J-lens result loses its provisional label. If instead the KL stays large in fp32,
the truncated stack does not faithfully reproduce the model and every J-lens number in this paper
must be withdrawn — the attention results, which do not depend on J-lens, would be unaffected
either way. The repaired self-check (Section 6) should be run on a fixed seeded set of at least 20
records at the same time, so the two agree on a single tolerance.


